{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础设施测试基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"testing-pyramid-infra","title":"基础设施测试金字塔","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/foundations/testing-pyramid-infra","wordCount":1609,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"test-driven-infrastructure","title":"测试驱动的基础设施","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/foundations/test-driven-infrastructure","wordCount":1179,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"testing-environments-strategies","title":"测试环境与策略","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/foundations/testing-environments-strategies","wordCount":1267,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 基础设施测试基础\n\n本章建立基础设施测试的认知框架。从测试金字塔的分层模型出发，理解不同层级测试的成本-收益曲线；再引入测试驱动基础设施（TDI）的工作流；最后探讨测试环境的隔离策略与资源管理。\n\n这三篇文档构成后续工具和实践的理论基底——不理解分层就无法正确选型工具，不理解环境隔离就会在集成测试中遭遇状态污染。\n"}